## TTS 스크립트 (영어, 70초)

```
Hello, this is a demonstration of our YouTube API usage.

This is our YouTube channel where we publish educational lifestyle content targeting Korean seniors aged 50 to 60.

Here are examples of our published videos. 
We create content about health tips, financial advice, and lifestyle guidance.
All content is family-friendly and educational.

Now, let me show you how we use the YouTube Data API.
Here in Postman, you can see the videos.insert API endpoint.
We send a POST request with video metadata and the file.

The API returns a successful response with the video ID.

In YouTube Studio, you can see the video has been uploaded successfully.

Before publishing, our team reviews each video for quality and policy compliance.
This ensures all content meets YouTube's community guidelines.

Thank you for reviewing our demonstration.
```

